      "content": "wait, what are you saying about goblins? i'm just trying to pass my lab and figure out the actual math here. \n\ncan we forget the \"goblin-repellent\" and \"goblin-proof fence\" stuff? it's making this way more confusing than it needs to be. \n\ncan you just explain the math behind windowing properly? specifically, how does applying a window function actually change the spectral leakage? i need to understand the actual technical mechanism, not a metaphor.",
